# Discovery and the birth message use the homeassistant prefix.
# Zigbee2MQTT publishes device state and reads commands under its base topic.
# Home Assistant sends lock actions under the Nuki prefix.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#
topic readwrite nuki/#

user zigbee2mqtt
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#

# The lock speaks plain MQTT from the LAN, so its login reaches nothing but its own topics and discovery.
user nuki
topic readwrite nuki/#
topic write homeassistant/#
topic read homeassistant/status
